  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dmadd9]\n[Dm6]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dmadd9]Indestructible\nOn this\nrock I lie But I'm a-\nlive for good And\nI just free myself\nnow From\nall what was wrong\nBreak the unbreakable\n\n[Bridge]\n[Dm6]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dmadd9]All the stars\nFear-\nlessly bright They\ncall me out there\nOrder me o face the wind\nMy\nstructure's alive\nMy body's on the way\nDon't bow down\nBe-\nfore the walls Of\nfear and madness\nThey try to counter me\nAnd\nstrike me\ndown To the ground again\n\n[Bridge]\n[Dm6]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Ddim]\n[F#dim]\n[Dmadd9]\n[Bb]\n[A]\n[Dmadd9]\n[F]  [Gm]\n[Dmadd9]\n[Bb]\n[A]\n[Dmadd9]\n[F]  [Gm]\n[F#dim]\n[Ddim]\n[Dmadd9]\n[Bb]\n[A]\n[Dmadd9]\n[F]  [Gm]\n[Dmadd9]\n[Bb]\n[A]\n[Dmadd9]\n[F]  [Gm]\n[Ddim]\n[Dmadd9]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dmadd9]Inexhaustible\nThe\nstrength of fire Is\nrunning through me\nSpine like beam of light\nWhat\nmortal could\never Break this force\nUnconstrained\nI\nsee at last\nMy backbone straightten\nThy serpent made of bones\nFinally rise up\nFrom the ground awaken\n\n[Bridge]\n[Dm6]\n\n[Outro]\n[Am]\nBeat your\nfeet On the ground now,\n[Dmadd9]go\n[Dm6]\n[Ddim]",
